/* [ 26] */ "'uv' aborted (exit code 134). If the output above says \"macOS ... or later required\", this 'uv' build needs a newer macOS than the one running. Install a uv version that runs on this macOS, e.g.\ncurl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/%s/install.sh | sh\nand point Tapir to it with \"uvLocation\" in Documents/Tapir/config.json, e.g.\n{ \"uvLocation\": \"/Users/<you>/.local/bin/uv\" }"
}

